  <h2>Interests</h2>
  <p>
    I studied Sanskrit for three semesters at Duke. I am deeply interested in Advaita Vedanta, the non-dual
    school of Indian philosophy, in the works of Adi Shankaracharya and the talks of Swami Sarvapriyananda.
    I am also interested in the philosophy of mind.
  </p>
  <p>
    I sing and play acoustic guitar, and I like trekking and cricket.
  </p>

